description	"Prototype BX-series Commando Droid

A highly experimental prototype droid designed by the Trade Federation, with enhanced agility via highly adaptive processors.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 30% faster RoF
- Vibrosword (Yellow Saber)
-- Saber Defense (1)
--- BP-Free Jumps
-- No Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 6
-- 38% shorter
- E-5 Blaster BX Custom (EE-4 3)
-- 10% less damage / FP damage

^5Powers:
- Hydraulic Legs (Jump 1)

^8Attributes:
- 20% less knockback taken
- 25% slower skill cooldown
- Battery Recharge (3)
- Getup (3)
- Beskar (1)
- Dexterity (3)

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS3]

A highly experimental prototype droid designed by the Trade Federation."